{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23342","headline":"和微之四月一日作 · 白居易","name":"和微之四月一日作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"四月一日天，花稀叶阴薄。\n泥新燕影忙，蜜熟蜂声乐。\n麦风低冉冉，稻水平漠漠。\n芳节或蹉跎，游心稍牢落。\n春华信爲美，夏景亦未恶。\n颭浪嫩青荷，重栏晚红药。\n吴宫好风月，越郡多楼阁。\n两地诚可怜，其奈久离索。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23342.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23342","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}